@startuml 04-toggle-theme
!include _style.iuml
title Activity 4 — Switch Between Dark and Light Mode

|#F7F5FB|User|
start
:Click the theme toggle\n("Light mode" / "Dark mode");

|#EEF3FB|Frontend (React)|
:toggleTheme() flips state\ndark ↔ light;
fork
  :useEffect sets\n<html data-color-scheme="…">;
  fork
    :App color tokens in index.css\nre-resolve (background, surface,\ntext and accent variables);
  fork again
    :FullCalendar monarch palette\nswitches its dark / light variables;
  end fork
fork again
  :Try localStorage.setItem\n("meetingloop-theme", theme);
  if (Storage available?) then (yes)
    :Preference saved for next visit;
  else (no — e.g. private mode)
    :Ignore; theme applies\nfor this visit only;
  endif
fork again
  :Re-render toggle button\n(sun ↔ moon icon and label);
end fork

|User|
:Sees the whole app in the new theme;
stop
@enduml
